MSL001: Trailing whitespace (warning)
  repair: delete the spaces or tabs at the end of the line; `ms check --only lint --fix` does it
MSL102: Unused import (warning)
  repair: remove the import or use the name; `ms check --only lint --fix` removes it
MS2002: Modules and imports
  repair: check the path, extension and [aliases] entry the message names
